        "sentence_id": "804e31c8b6f3feb583b9a1d3b228fd38",
        "sentence_text": "RECENT FINDINGS Current research is shedding new light on the role of both T helper cell (Th)1 and Th17 responses in the pathogenesis of Crohn's disease.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 37,
        "source_order": [
          525,
          0,
