        "passage_rank": 1,
        "query_id": "975",
        "sentence_id": "7eaf4e572086a8a0bc3164c1187c271a",
        "sentence_text": "In recent years, however, this view has been largely eclipsed by studies, conducted mainly in murine models, showing that a Th17 response is the main cause of Crohn's disease inflammation through the production of interleukin-17.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 51,
        "source_order": [
          525,
          0,
          4,
          0
        ],
        "source_position": 756
      },
      {
