        "query_id": "975",
        "sentence_id": "5d244faf4d352c1c78afdcd01f22f049",
        "sentence_text": "Now, a somewhat more balanced view is emerging, which holds that interferon-gamma is still a major proinflammatory cytokine in Crohn's disease, although it may arise from both the Th1 and Th17-mediated responses at different phases of the inflammatory process.   ",
        "sentence_token_cost": 56,
        "source_order": [
