        "sentence_id": "5fcfb75b9ed336366128aa6e986e0719",
        "sentence_text": "The increasing understanding of the role of cytokines in autoimmunity, and the observation that tumour necrosis factor alpha (TNFalpha) is central to the inflammatory and destructive process common to several human autoimmune diseases, has led to a new generation of therapeutics, the TNFalpha blocking agents.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 61,
