        "query_id": "975",
        "sentence_id": "818c1bbc02e6846525d5fd362c830803",
        "sentence_text": "In addition, we discuss future prospects of the anti-TNFalpha therapy that may involve combination therapy with other anti-cytokine or anti-T cell biologicals, or the use of small chemicals targeting molecules involved in TNFalpha production such as NF-kappaB and p38 MAPK.",
