        "query_id": "975",
        "sentence_id": "cff7c2a58f8bd453c6e42caacd6fe39e",
        "sentence_text": "IL-6 has context-dependent pro- and anti-inflammatory properties and is now regarded as a prominent target for clinical intervention.",
