        "sentence_id": "7fffc92d81d8ebec466b6e30ed5507a1",
        "sentence_text": "Type 2 immune responses are defined by the cytokines interleukin-4 (IL-4), IL-5, IL-9 and IL-13, which can either be host protective or have pathogenic activity.",
