        "passage_rank": 3,
        "query_id": "975",
        "sentence_id": "11d19683164359c5c26b1c9d59454adc",
        "sentence_text": "Type 2 immunity promotes antihelminth immunity, suppresses type 1-driven autoimmune disease, neutralizes toxins, maintains metabolic homeostasis, and regulates wound repair and tissue regeneration pathways following infection or injury.",
