        "query_id": "975",
        "sentence_id": "9be203f81334ed0b5b0bfdf80ef503ec",
        "sentence_text": "As chronic type 2 immune responses promote disease, the mechanisms that regulate their maintenance are thought to function as crucial disease modifiers.",
