        "sentence_id": "37ac8bb82fdbb794d73764d205692c74",
        "sentence_text": "It is now clear that IFN\u03b3 is capable of both pro- and anti-inflammatory activities with the functional outcome dependent on the physiological and pathological setting examined.",
